    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Nina Barker, daughter of a renowned biblical scholar who neglected her for his work, tried everything from suicide attempts to affairs with older lovers to drugs to gain his attention, without success. Raped and left for dead in an Amsterdam alley, she was Embraced by a Serpent of the Light impressed by her degradation. She hunted down her mortal father, Dominated him into forgetting his faith, and stripped every memory from his mind before presenting the hollow shell of him as a tribute to the Widows of Montreal, whom she joined as &quot;Black Lotus.&quot; She takes pleasure in stripping educated men of their memories and everything they've learned, earning the enmity of the scholarly Librarians coven.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Cunning. Your eyes, though seductive, are those of a predator, coldly searching for your next victim. You especially delight in seducing older men and women.</p><h2>Secrets</h2><p>Nina learns much of the Shepherds' business from Raphael Catarari, who visits her regularly, and habitually steals a little of each client's past without their knowledge.</p>",
    "notes": "Embraced 1983. Apparent age: late teens. Path of Power and the Inner Voice 6. Disciplines (as printed): Auspex 3, Dementation 4, Dominate 5, Obfuscate 1, Presence 2, Serpentis 2.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
